      "content": "wait 600mg per dose?? that sounds like a lot for a little kid. the doctor said 40mg per kg every day, i thought that meant the total for the whole day was 600mg. do i give him the whole 7.5ml at once or is that supposed to be split up? like do i do it once a day or is it 3 times a day? please be sure, i'm really nervous about giving him too much.",
